@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About - Optimizely Learning Centre</PageTitle>

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div
        class="rounded-2xl p-8 relative overflow-hidden shadow-lg dark:shadow-none dark:border dark:border-gray-700 bg-blue-600 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-blue-500 dark:bg-gray-800 dark:from-gray-800 dark:to-gray-900 dark:border-l-4 dark:border-l-blue-500">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start gap-6 relative z-10">
            <div
                class="w-24 h-24 rounded-full bg-white/20 dark:bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-12 h-12 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2"
                        d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z" />
                </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-1 text-white">Graham Carr</h1>
                <p class="text-white/90 text-lg mb-3">Solutions Architect | Platinum OMVP</p>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                    <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-white/20 text-white">Optimizely
                        Expert</span>
                    <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-medium bg-white/20 text-white">28 Years in
                        Tech</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bio Section -->
    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-body space-y-4">
            <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 dark:text-gray-100">About Me</h2>

            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                I'm Graham Carr, a Solutions Architect and Platinum OMVP with 28 years in tech—and still genuinely
                excited about building things for the web.
            </p>

            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                I specialise in CMS platforms (Optimizely is my home turf), cloud infrastructure on AWS and Azure, and
                the kind of complex digital projects that keep you thinking at 2am. These days, I'm particularly focused
                on headless architecture, working with Optimizely SaaS, 11ty, Vercel, and modern front-end tooling. I
                care about performance, accessibility, and building websites that don't cost the earth—literally.
                Sustainable web practices matter.
            </p>

            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                Currently at Netcel, I've previously worked with MSQ DX, Dept Agency UK, and Provident Financial
                Group—tackling everything from enterprise-scale builds to intricate integration challenges. I've got a
                BSc Hons in Information Systems, but honestly, most of what I know came from shipping real projects and
                learning from the people around me.
            </p>

            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                I solve problems, lead teams, and mentor developers. I've learned that the best solutions come from
                asking better questions, not just writing better code.
            </p>

            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                I'm also active in the Optimizely community as a Platinum OMVP—sharing what I learn through blog posts,
                LinkedIn, and the occasional presentation. Tech moves fast, and I think out loud.
            </p>

            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed">
                Certified in Optimizely (multiple times over), AWS Solutions Architect, and Umbraco Master—because
                credentials matter, but so does staying curious. I'm always learning something new, whether that's
                exploring AI-powered content tools or digging into the latest platform updates.
            </p>

            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 leading-relaxed font-medium">
                If you're here, you probably care about the same things I do: building digital experiences that actually
                work, perform well, and make a difference.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Connect Section -->
    <div>
